I hadn't done that before, but I did now, and updated the chart accordingly.

Tiki activity (like IRC activity) was flat from 2003-2004, but afterwards 
has largely risen and fallen along with the mailing list. The busiest year 
in the tiki was 2010, with nearly 2,000 edits.

The most active tiki editor is rlpowell. There's no close second, but 
xorxes, totus, selpa'i, Broca and Matt Arnold have the next most edits.

